\"><li>Healer</li></ul> When you find yourself low on health you can switch your spirit guide back to its fox form which will replenish your health over time<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Compass</li></ul> During your journey the fox will guide you in an effort to help you get back home","developers":["Elusive Panda"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211040/header.jpg?t=1699660148","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2022-\u221e  Elusive Panda Games. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2211040/512381/8a36a0e333838f6b0b393c939cfbae1c7044764b/1751090602/dash_av1.mpd?t=1667996856","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2211040/512381/8a36a0e333838f6b0b393c939cfbae1c7044764b/1751090602/dash_h264.mpd?t=1667996856","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2211040/512381/8a36a0e333838f6b0b393c939cfbae1c7044764b/1751090602/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1667996856","id":256915389,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256915389/movie480.mp4?t=1667996856","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256915389/movie_max.mp4?t=1667996856"},"name":"HD Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256915389/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1667996856","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256915389/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1667996856","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256915389/movie_max_